# A matching PCI device loads nvidia via its modalias. Bring up its DRM/KMS
# companion too, before leaving the initramfs. Other vendors do not load it.
# Both an early-bound device and a later bind are handled. The kmod builtin
# respects module blacklists; explicit rd.driver.pre remains available.
ACTION=="add|bind", SUBSYSTEM=="pci", DRIVER=="nvidia", RUN{builtin}+="kmod load nvidia_drm"
